cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OncoPattern in academic or technical work, please cite it as below."
title: "OncoPattern: cancer pattern analysis, simulation and reporting on the TECH toolchain"
abstract: >-
  OncoPattern is a cancer pattern-analysis, simulation, visualisation and
  reporting platform written entirely in .tech and running on the self-hosting
  TECH toolchain. It ingests genomic, histological and clinical data, detects
  registered patterns, runs mechanistic simulations, renders framebuffers and
  byte-exact reports, and can be executed end to end without any other language.
  The software is a demonstration platform, not a medical device.
